IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL. SELECT SW ASSIGN TO 'w'. SELECT IN-F ASSIGN TO 'i'. SELECT OUT-F ASSIGN TO 'o'. DATA DIVISION. FILE SECTION. SD SW. 01 SR. 05 K1 PIC 9. FD IN-F. 01 IR PIC X. FD OUT-F. 01 OR-REC PIC X. PROCEDURE DIVISION. SORT SW ON ASCENDING KEY K1 WITH DUPLICATES IN ORDER USING IN-F GIVING OUT-F. DISPLAY 'OK'.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'OK' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "OK"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [OK] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN.

